Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.98,0:00:06.38,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(629.198,461.883)\\fade(255,0,255,0,850,4650,5380)}Episode 42\N \N\N\NThe Beauty Trap
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.70,0:00:12.82,Thinking,,0,0,0,,In the 14th year of the Jian'an era, 209 CE,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.11,0:00:17.36,Thinking,NTP,0,0,0,,Liu Bei and Zhuge Liang made use of Zhou Yu's recuperation at Chaisang.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.36,0:00:20.16,Thinking,NTP,0,0,0,,Seeing Sun Quan's defeat at Hefei,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.32,0:00:26.23,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Liu Bei conquered Lingling, Wuling, Guiyang and \NChangsha commanderies all in one fell swoop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.47,0:00:31.09,Thinking,NTP,0,0,0,,When Liu Bei was celebrating his victory,\N a messenger from Xiangyang came,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.09,0:00:35.20,Thinking,NTP,0,0,0,,informing that Noble Son Liu Qi had passed away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.74,0:00:55.70,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(341.603,485.454)\\fade(255,0,255,0,400,5140,5540)}Liú Bèi\NStyled: Xuándé
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.91,0:00:54.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The Noble Son lost his mother as a child
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.00,0:00:56.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,and his stepmother tried to harm him all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.24,0:01:03.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,And now when he is finally independent, he dies this young.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.23,0:01:07.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,It really fills one with sorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.12,0:01:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Life and death are predetermined. \NWe cannot oppose Heaven's will.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.35,0:01:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You must restrain your grief and dedicate\N yourself to the defense of Jing Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.64,0:01:22.40,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,499.091)\\fade(255,0,255,0,400,5380,5740)}Zhūgé Liàng\NStyled: Kǒngmíng
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.24,0:01:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Sun Quan has retreated from Hefei to Nanxu.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.88,0:01:25.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,If Zhou Yu hears about Liu Qi's premature death,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.57,0:01:28.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,he will definitely demand \NJing Province. We must defend it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.49,0:01:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, Lu Su of Eastern Wu has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.34,0:01:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos, Lu Zijing has come\N because of Jing Province. That...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.58,0:01:58.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,My lord, just focus on receiving him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.77,0:02:03.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,If he brings up Jing Province at all, I know how to answer him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.09,0:02:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Imperial Uncle! Sir Zhuge!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.39,0:02:12.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,My lord has heard of the passing of your nephew.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.08,0:02:16.08,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(327.014,495.585)\\fade(255,0,255,0,400,4180,4980)}Lǔ Sù\NStyled: Zǐjìng
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.63,0:02:15.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,He has prepared some gifts and sent me to offer sacrifices.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.03,0:02:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander Zhou once more sends his regards to the Imperial Uncle and Sir Zhuge.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.46,0:02:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,-Very well. Accept the sacrifices. \N-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.80,0:02:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be exhausted, Zijing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.48,0:02:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us talk in the rear hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.28,0:03:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,-Please.\N-Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.99,0:03:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.43,0:03:24.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, last time I was in Jing Province, you said something, Imperial Uncle,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.40,0:03:28.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,that when the Noble Son was gone, you would return Jing Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.54,0:03:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that the young master has passed away, \NI hope you will not go back on your promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.81,0:03:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So when is the transfer to be completed?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.38,0:03:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,About that...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.38,0:03:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijing, you have come from afar.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.10,0:03:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Right! You must be exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.96,0:03:51.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,We have missed you after all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.07,0:03:55.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,We should catch up first, then we can discuss matters more carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.28,0:03:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.27,0:04:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheers, Zijing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.41,0:04:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.48,0:04:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,To celebrate this meeting, let us drink some more.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.55,0:04:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheers! Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.19,0:04:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.28,0:04:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.909\pos(640,670)}Imperial Uncle, Sir Zhuge,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.50,0:04:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.909\pos(640,670)}I have never treated you with hostility,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.67,0:04:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.909}but when it comes to matters of state, \Nthere is no room for private feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.68,0:04:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.909}{\pos(640,670)}As I see it,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.20,0:04:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord13.909}we should first negotiate the return of Jing Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.16,0:04:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord13.909}If we do not, how will I explain it to my lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.80,0:04:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord13.909}How irrational of you, Zijing,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.47,0:04:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord13.909}to force others to argue with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.36,0:05:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord13.909}Speaking of disagreements with the borders
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.62,0:05:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord13.909}like whose land is whose
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.99,0:05:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord13.909}cannot solely be decided by Eastern Wu.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.70,0:05:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.909}Ever since our First Emperor slew the serpent and built our nation,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.68,0:05:16.90,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Referencing the tale of "Slaying of the White Serpent" (斬白蛇起義), in which Liu Bang slew a white snake representing the reign of Qin Dynasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.82,0:05:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord13.909}Heaven has been returned to a just rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.11,0:05:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord13.909}This has lasted for more than 400 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.96,0:05:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.909}My lord is a descendant of \NPrince Jing of Zhongshan,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.70,0:05:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.909}a descendant of Emperor Xiaojing, {\bord13.909}and uncle of the current Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.96,0:05:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.909}Does he not have the right to the land of his ancestors?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.36,0:05:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord13.909}Moreover, Liu Jingsheng was my lord's elder brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.46,0:05:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.909}The younger succeeds the older, \Nand yet this is unsuitable?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.07,0:05:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord13.909}Sir, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.01,0:05:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.909}Sun Zhongmou is but a son of a petty official from Qiantang.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.60,0:05:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.909}He has not rendered any service to the imperial court.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.12,0:05:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.909}With his strength, he has taken \Nsix commanderies and 81 counties,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.00,0:05:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.909}yet his greed goes even deeper: {\bord13.909}he intends to conquer all the lands of the Han!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.20,0:05:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord13.909}Let me ask you, Zijing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.76,0:06:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.909}The Liu clan rules the empire, but the one surnamed Liu does not get a share.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.70,0:06:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord13.909}Instead, the one named Sun claims it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.70,0:06:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord13.909}What sense of logic is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.76,0:06:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord13.909}Besides, in the fierce battle of Chibi,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.76,0:06:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.909}my lord toiled diligently\Nand his generals resisted Cao Cao.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.17,0:06:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord13.909}How can all the credit go to Eastern Wu?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.56,0:06:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord13.909}Were it not for my calling of the east winds,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.72,0:06:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.909}how could Zhou the Youth \Nhave achieved half of what he did?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.40,0:06:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord13.909}If the south had been defeated,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.99,0:06:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.909}not only would the two Qiaos \Nbe in Bronze Sparrow Terrace,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.00,0:06:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord13.909}but your family too would be in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.24,0:06:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord13.909}Currently, my lord has not responded,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.60,0:06:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord13.909}because we believed you are most wise, Zijing,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.86,0:06:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord13.909}you would not need the gritty issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.86,0:06:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord13.909}How could you have no insight to our intentions?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.60,0:06:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.74,0:06:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, I cannot quite say you are in the wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.11,0:07:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,but it would be quite problematic for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.12,0:07:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,In what way is it problematic?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.32,0:07:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Imperial Uncle, you were in trouble \Nbefore in Dangyang with nowhere to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.82,0:07:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It was I who led you across the Yangzi to visit my liege.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.86,0:07:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Thus, the Sun and Liu families united to defeat the Cao.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.27,0:07:21.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Later, when Zhou Gongjin wished to lead an army to take Jing Province,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.58,0:07:25.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,it was also I who objected to him over and over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.34,0:07:30.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,He said that when the Noble Son died, he would then return Jing Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.30,0:07:32.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I made great effort to honor this agreement.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.95,0:07:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But now you have reneged.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.43,0:07:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,To that, what would I report back with?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.69,0:07:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed, the Marquis of Wu and Chief Commander Zhou would be furious at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.18,0:07:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,My death would be irrelevant. I only fear irritating Eastern Wu would lead to a major conflict,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.10,0:07:57.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,and then the Imperial Uncle would then be unable to hold onto Jing Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.29,0:08:00.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,How can this not be jeered at by the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.02,0:08:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Cao Cao uses the name of the Emperor to\N command millions of men, and yet I am not worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.26,0:08:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I be terrified of Zhou the Youth?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.77,0:08:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Since it will be hard to justify yourself, Zijing,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.44,0:08:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I will urge my lord to compose a message, \Nexplaining he will borrow Jing temporarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.48,0:08:37.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Wait until we seize another foothold
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.64,0:08:40.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,and then we will return Jing to Eastern Wu.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.89,0:08:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,How is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.09,0:08:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What will you claim before you return Jing Province?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.86,0:08:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We cannot rapidly take the Central Plains.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.16,0:09:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But Liu Zhang of the Western Riverlands is puny. My lord shall soon subdue him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.25,0:09:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as we conquer the Western Riverlands, we will return Jing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.98,0:09:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I ask the Imperial Uncle to write such a message!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.58,0:09:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.46,0:10:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go, Zijing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.17,0:10:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I still need you to be our witness, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.08,0:10:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I ask that you make your signature.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.75,0:10:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine. If that is the case, I will make my guarantee.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.67,0:10:48.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,But I am just a subordinate of my liege.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.41,0:10:51.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Wouldn't I only serve as my own guarantor, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.98,0:10:58.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,May I ask you to sign as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.32,0:11:01.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,It will be more official when you give it to the Marquis of Wu.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.89,0:11:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.13,0:11:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I know the Imperial Uncle to be a benevolent person.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.42,0:11:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely he will not trick me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.18,0:11:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijing, upon your return, express our thoughts tactfully.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.11,0:11:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The Marquis must not get the wrong idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.10,0:11:33.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,If he does not accept our document, we will change our minds
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.54,0:11:35.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,and conquer the 81 counties ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.59,0:11:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijing is most wise, valuing harmony between us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.79,0:11:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We cannot let the Cao Cao ridicule us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.67,0:11:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,In the end, someone as naive as me troubles both sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.58,0:11:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.85,0:12:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, the Lady is severely ill and asks you to return at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.25,0:12:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Worry not, my Lord. Let us go and inquire about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.99,0:12:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.33,0:12:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse us, Zijing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.45,0:12:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Do as you must, Imperial Uncle, Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.14,0:12:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijing, you have fallen into Zhuge Liang's trap once more!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.24,0:12:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,How so?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.92,0:12:35.80,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(299.747,463.637)\\fade(255,0,255,0,450,4490,4860)}Zhōu Yú\NStyled: Gōngjǐn
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.38,0:12:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,They claim to be borrowing it,\N but they are just delaying its return!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.48,0:12:38.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,They promised to return it\Nafter taking the Western Riverlands.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.74,0:12:41.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,So if he takes ten years,\N will he not return it until then?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.32,0:12:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What use is there for this letter?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.79,0:12:47.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You also signed it as its witness.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.28,0:12:51.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,If they do not return it, our lord will blame you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.30,0:12:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Liu Xuande would never deceive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.84,0:13:04.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Liu Bei is a most ambitious man \Nand Zhuge Liang is proficient in strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.59,0:13:08.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I am afraid they are not as\N righteous and honest as you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.05,0:13:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.10,0:13:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijing, do not worry yourself. \NYou, sir, are my benefactor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.37,0:13:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Back when I rose up in arms, I encountered you, and I asked for provisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.34,0:13:38.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You merely had two granaries,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.62,0:13:40.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,but gave me one of them as a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.41,0:13:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I will never forget your kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.10,0:13:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you are in trouble,\Nhow can I watch and do nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.56,0:13:50.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You have just come to report
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.13,0:13:55.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,that Liu Bei's wife, Lady Gan, passed away, \Nand that her funeral is being planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.60,0:14:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a plan to force Zhuge Liang to hand me Jing on a silver plate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.74,0:14:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, what is your plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.97,0:14:09.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,After Liu Bei buries his wife, \Nhe will have to remarry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.78,0:14:13.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Our lord has a tough and brave younger sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.10,0:14:18.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,She has a hundred female attendants who often carry sabers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.23,0:14:21.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Even in a room full of weapons,\N a man will be no match for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.71,0:14:27.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I will ask the Marquis to send an envoy to Jing "offering" a marriage so as to lure Liu Bei to join her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.74,0:14:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we trick him into coming to Nanxu so we can imprison him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.17,0:14:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,After that, we will send an envoy\N asking for Jing in exchange for Liu Bei.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.57,0:14:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I am grateful for your help, Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.48,0:14:46.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Wait until I go back and report to our lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.55,0:14:51.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Thereafter, we will send an envoy to Jing, offering a marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.29,0:14:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,There is only one person fit for this task.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.13,0:14:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Who may that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.58,0:15:02.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Inform our lord that the one to go to Jing
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.72,0:15:07.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,can be no other than Lü Fan, styled Ziheng.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.73,0:15:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Restrain your sorrow, my lord.\N Your health is most important.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.60,0:15:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Lady Gan was bedridden for too long.\N She could not stand the suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.44,0:15:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that she has passed away,\N she escaped the pains of the material world.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.55,0:15:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the good side to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.79,0:16:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,She accompanied me for decades. We went through many hardships together.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.69,0:16:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The grief in my heart is too difficult to reconcile myself with.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.10,0:16:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Lü Fan of Eastern Wu has arrived. \NHe is waiting at the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.77,0:16:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos, why has Lü Fan come?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.58,0:16:29.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,This Lü Ziheng followed Sun Ce in his early years.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.12,0:16:34.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,They went through many difficult ordeals together, and so he was heavily trusted as a result.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.49,0:16:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,As I see it, he is trusted by Sun Quan as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.26,0:16:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,So he is one of his trusted officials?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.36,0:16:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I fear sending such a man
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.07,0:16:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,has unknown reasons behind it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.71,0:17:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard you lost your spouse, Imperial Uncle. \NThe Marquis of Wu sent me to offer sacrifices.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.22,0:17:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Being a widower in my middle age is a most unfortunate event.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.24,0:17:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It really is. A man without a wife is like a house without a roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.80,0:17:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Xuande, you are the Imperial Uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.60,0:17:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you still be a widower in middle age?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.94,0:17:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.92,0:17:31.32,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(344.304,435)\\fade(255,0,255,0,390,3020,3380)}Lǚ Fàn \NStyled: Zǐhéng
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.67,0:17:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a good match, but I would like to know your opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.60,0:17:37.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Lady Gan and I went through many things together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.64,0:17:42.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Her corpse is not yet cold. \NHow can I think of marriage now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.36,0:17:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Imperial Uncle, my lord has a younger sister. She is beautiful and virtuous.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.53,0:17:53.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,If we join in marriage like Qin and Jin did in the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.53,0:17:56.14,Note (Potential style?),NTP,0,0,0,,Note: Referring to the marriage alliance between Qin and Jin states of the Spring and Autumn period, beginning with Duke Mu of Qin marrying the daughter of Duke Xian of Jin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.46,0:17:56.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,then Cao Cao will not dare to look down on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.67,0:18:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a matter of concern for both parties. \NDo not hesitate, Imperial Uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.48,0:18:06.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,However, the State Mother loves her daughter and will not accept a distant marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.62,0:18:10.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Please go to Eastern Wu for the marriage, then you may return to Jing Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.22,0:18:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the Marquis of Wu aware of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.71,0:18:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Would I dare promise his \Nyounger sister without his knowledge?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.43,0:18:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I am already half a century old. \NThe Marquis of Wu's sister is so young.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.72,0:18:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I fear we do not match.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.24,0:18:39.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Sir, the Marquis of Wu's sister may be a girl,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.08,0:18:41.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,but she is very ambitious, more so than most men.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.86,0:18:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,She often says that she will never marry unless it is with one of the heroes of the land.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.92,0:18:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Your fame spreads throughout the four corners of the country. You are the hero she desires.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.83,0:18:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you reject her based on some age difference?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.14,0:19:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Please wait. Give me a day\N to consider this. Is that okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.68,0:19:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well, I shall leave you to it. I will withdraw for the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.88,0:19:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.29,0:19:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.94,0:19:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,My congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.14,0:19:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What is there to congratulate me about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.93,0:19:34.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Although Lü Fan has come to propose a marriage,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.43,0:19:37.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I fear that if I go, more bad luck will afflict me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.94,0:19:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, you can absolutely accept this marriage proposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.61,0:19:49.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,This proposal is clearly Zhou Yu's ploy \Nto take Jing Province through a Beauty Trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.15,0:19:56.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,But, though this journey seems dangerous, it will be smooth and without trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.02,0:19:59.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You may set out without worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.89,0:20:02.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Zhou Yu has wanted to kill me for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.83,0:20:05.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,How could I enter a tiger's den so easily?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.07,0:20:10.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Though he is good at strategy, \Nhow could he outsmart me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.92,0:20:15.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,With but a small scheme, I can see Zhou Yu's strategy fall in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.51,0:20:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Moreover, the Marquis of Wu's sister will be yours. Jing Province will not be lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.45,0:20:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This visit will serve our alliance strategy. One could say we would be killing two birds with one stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.85,0:20:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So I can go?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.10,0:20:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You may go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.38,0:20:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.08,0:20:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You may really go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.62,0:21:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well. I will take this risk for the state.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.54,0:21:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,May I ask Strategos... is it better that I stay here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.12,0:21:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.66,0:21:44.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I ordered Sun Qian to Jiangnan to talk about the marriage alliance,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.42,0:21:47.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,and I will also send Zilong as an escort.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.63,0:21:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You can cross the river at ease, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.24,0:21:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.22,0:22:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This way, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.69,0:22:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.75,0:22:19.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,After thinking about this,\N I think this is inappropriate.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.33,0:22:22.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I still think it is better that I stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.94,0:22:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.30,0:22:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Two days ago, I crossed the river with Lü Fan and met Sun Quan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.72,0:22:33.72,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(738.565,477.272)\\fade(255,0,255,0,400,4600,4900)}Sūn Qián\NStyled: Gōngyòu
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.43,0:22:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He is willing to marry you to his sister. There is no treachery at play.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.05,0:22:34.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,He expects you to come and marry her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.80,0:22:38.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,If he walks back on his word, \Nwill he not become a laughingstock?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.22,0:22:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongyou is right. Do not hesitate, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.74,0:22:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.40,0:22:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.03,0:22:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, Zilong.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.40,0:23:05.96,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(353.755,504.546)\\fade(255,0,255,0,400,5260,5540)}Zhào Yún\NStyled: Zǐlóng
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.74,0:23:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Zilong, protect our lord on his way to Wu. \NTake these three silk bags with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.08,0:23:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,These bags each have a plan in them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.29,0:23:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,In an emergency, you must open them by order.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.96,0:23:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Just do as they state and \Ndanger will turn into fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.13,0:23:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well. I will remember, Strategos.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.24,0:23:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.74,0:23:34.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Send someone to Eastern Wu to receive the betrothal gifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.68,0:23:37.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Pack the necessary things into the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.38,0:23:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood. Strategos, please stay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.11,0:23:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well, go then.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.60,0:24:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is nobody coming to greet us\N when they have asked for my hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.39,0:24:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You are right...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.55,0:24:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.73,0:25:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. Let us do as the Strategos has planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.53,0:25:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.17,0:25:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord. Liu Bei has arrived at Nanxu.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.78,0:25:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Liu Bei is at Nanxu...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.16,0:25:22.24,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(313.249,463.637)\\fade(255,0,255,0,300,4780,5060)}Sūn Quán\NStyled: Zhòngmóu
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.98,0:25:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Ziheng. Hurry to the river and receive him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.08,0:25:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Guide him to his lodging house. \NI will deal with him later.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.32,0:25:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What to do if Liu Bei wants to see you, Marquis?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.06,0:25:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Just say I am busy with state affairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.04,0:25:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.23,0:25:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.97,0:25:45.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,After Liu Bei crosses the river, do not alert the common folk.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.31,0:25:48.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,They cannot hear of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.57,0:25:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.62,0:26:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.29,0:26:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Inform our lord immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.39,0:26:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Imperial Uncle! Excuse me for my delay!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.30,0:26:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Greetings, Imperial Uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.44,0:26:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You honor us with your presence. Excuse me for my delay, it was very rude of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.44,0:26:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,This way, Imperial Uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.49,0:27:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Which family does the bride belong to?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.00,0:27:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Right this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.14,0:27:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Which family does the bride belong to?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.88,0:27:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Pay attention, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.04,0:27:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The Marquis of Wu sent \NLu Fan to discuss a marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.16,0:27:44.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,He went to Jing Province to ask my lord, the Imperial Uncle, to come here
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.02,0:27:46.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,and marry the precious daughter of Wu!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.42,0:27:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I ask all of you to let us through. Clear the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.94,0:27:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of the way! Out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.22,0:28:20.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Imperial Uncle, please rest here first.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.75,0:28:23.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Once the Marquis of Wu has time, he will come see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.00,0:28:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood. You can be on your way then.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.77,0:28:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall take my leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.64,0:28:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us go to the home of State Elder Qiao.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.61,0:28:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.48,0:28:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me. Where is the residence of State Elder Qiao?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.75,0:28:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Come with us. We'll take you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.40,0:29:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Liu Bei, offer my greetings to you, State Elder Qiao.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.27,0:29:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Imperial Uncle, your presence brings joy to this old man's home.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.55,0:29:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.35,0:29:20.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I have known you to be a virtuous and prestigious man, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.75,0:29:23.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,To see you today is enough fortune for three lifetimes!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.86,0:29:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You praise me too much, Imperial Uncle!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.61,0:29:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.77,0:29:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.72,0:29:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We brought you this meager gift to show our appreciation. Please accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.64,0:30:04.56,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(968.101,409.091)\\fade(255,0,255,0,300,2500,2900)}State Elder Qiáo
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.81,0:30:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Imperial Uncle, it's too much, it's too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.38,0:30:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I have long admired your virtue, Lord Qiao. \NI regret not meeting you any sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.22,0:30:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Think of the adversities the Sun and Liu clans have gone through. We are as close as lips and teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.46,0:30:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We defeated Cao Cao at Chibi,\N and thanks to us, the land is divided three ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.27,0:30:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I have always held you\N in high regard, Imperial Uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.65,0:30:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I intended to go to Jing Province earlier to pay my respects,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.45,0:31:00.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,but I did not think you would deign to come all the way here to visit my humble abode.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.57,0:31:04.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I am embarrassed.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.49,0:31:07.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You wield great prestige in this land.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.58,0:31:11.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,This token of my appreciation is not as much respect as you deserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.57,0:31:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I see how courteous you are, \NI know that you live up to your reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.33,0:31:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You praise me too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.15,0:31:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Dare I ask what distinguished \Nbusiness brings you to Nanxu?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.66,0:31:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What? State Elder...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.67,0:31:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You did not receive news of such an important affair?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.49,0:31:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.76,0:31:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,State Elder,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.04,0:32:00.40,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(306.498,436.363)\\fade(255,0,255,0,400,5020,5340)}Sūn Qián\NStyled: Gōngyòu
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.64,0:31:58.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,the Marquis of Wu sent Lü Fan to \NJing to talk about a formal alliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.95,0:32:04.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,He arranged a marriage between his sister and \NLiu Bei that shall be as strong as that of Qin and Jin.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.43,0:32:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He must disdain me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.00,0:32:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He must disdain me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.31,0:32:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,State Elder Qiao has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.04,0:32:38.40,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(374.008,409.091)\\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3000,3340)}State Mother Wú
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.98,0:32:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It has been a while. Invite him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.89,0:32:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,State Elder!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.32,0:32:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,State Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.69,0:32:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You look good lately. It even\N seems you are getting younger!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.90,0:32:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I have come just to congratulate you, State Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.90,0:32:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What is there to congratulate me about?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.77,0:33:04.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Your dear daughter has been betrothed to the Imperial Uncle, Liu Xuande.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.98,0:33:08.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Is it not a most felicitous event?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.58,0:33:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Who told you that? How can I be \Nunaware of such an important matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.22,0:33:17.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, the news is spreading throughout the streets of Nanxu!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.64,0:33:21.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,How else could I have known?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.38,0:33:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-Servants!\N-Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.73,0:33:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Go to town and ask around. Report to me at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.81,0:33:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.11,0:33:36.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I am grateful you have informed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.42,0:33:38.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Otherwise, I would have remained in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.85,0:33:40.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-Serve tea. \N-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.75,0:33:42.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,How can you be this incompetent?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.96,0:33:46.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Liu Xuande came to marry into our family, \Nbut now the whole city knows of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.09,0:33:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It is that Zhuge Liang is full of tricks.\N I cannot guard against them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.30,0:33:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.77,0:34:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Be more vigilant.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.24,0:34:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not let Liu Xuande take a step outside his lodging!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.10,0:34:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.91,0:34:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Servants!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.61,0:34:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.68,0:34:17.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Close the rear yard immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.88,0:34:22.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,If Liu Xuande comes to marry, do not let \Nthe matter leak lest the State Mother finds out!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.72,0:34:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.89,0:34:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Here is some exquisite tea Zhongmou\Ngave me to show his filial piety.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.97,0:34:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Please try it, State Elder.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.94,0:34:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What extraordinary flavor!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.68,0:34:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'd rather be drinking a toast to your daughter's marriage!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.12,0:34:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,These are but unfounded rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.76,0:34:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,State Mother, there really is a marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.52,0:34:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone on the streets knows of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.29,0:35:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The lodging house has hung lanterns \Nand the Imperial Uncle has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.29,0:35:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,There are two matchmakers. \NOurs is Lü Fan, theirs is Sun Qian.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.97,0:35:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring Zhongmou to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.51,0:35:15.17,Default,,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.31,0:35:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, what matter is it\N that you summoned me?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.02,0:35:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, why are you giving me that look?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.79,0:35:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, why are you so sad?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.47,0:35:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Step away.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.24,0:35:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of person do you think I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.54,0:35:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You have raised me since I was little.\N I see you as my own mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.41,0:35:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So you still remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.05,0:36:02.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,My sister entrusted you to me before she died.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.19,0:36:07.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I raised you and your sister, and it was not easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.03,0:36:10.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Now that you are one of the rulers of the nation,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.87,0:36:13.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,how can you be so careless?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.27,0:36:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I... how could I dare to do such?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.17,0:36:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to talk, \Nplease do not be so upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.40,0:36:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I not be upset?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.38,0:36:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,A grown man must take a bride and a grown woman must take a husband. This is tradition.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.45,0:36:34.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You have given your sister in marriage to Liu Xuande.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.36,0:36:38.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I act as your mother, so why did you not tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.66,0:36:40.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Why have you hid this from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.71,0:36:44.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Perhaps your sister is not \Na daughter of my own flesh and blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.87,0:36:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Where have you heard this?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.17,0:36:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you still trying to deceive me?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.14,0:37:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no one in Nanxu who has not heard of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.28,0:37:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You intended to deceive me and only me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.39,0:37:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,State Elder.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.86,0:37:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhongmou, I am aware as well. \NI have come to congratulate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.61,0:37:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, you are mistaken. This is Zhou Yu's stratagem.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.25,0:37:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,He has designed it to recover Jing Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.28,0:37:38.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,His intent was to trick Liu Bei here and detain him,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.23,0:37:41.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,then force Zhuge Liang to exchange Jing Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.05,0:37:43.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,If he refuses, we will kill Liu Bei.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.54,0:37:46.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I am not actually marrying my sister off!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.46,0:37:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What a repulsive man, to do something this vulgar!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.90,0:37:53.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Zhou Yu is the State Elder's dear son-in-law,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.26,0:37:56.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,in charge of six commanderies and 81 counties.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.20,0:38:01.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Yet he still cannot think of anything smarter \Nthan using my own daughter for a "beauty trap"?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.07,0:38:03.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,And if you kill Liu Bei,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.40,0:38:06.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,my dear daughter would become a widow!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.42,0:38:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,How could she marry again?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.34,0:38:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you not ruining my daughter's life?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.65,0:38:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,But... mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.42,0:38:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhongmou.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.32,0:38:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You are not thinking clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.49,0:38:25.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Even if the plan succeeds and you take Jing,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.61,0:38:28.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,you will be ridiculed by the entire realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.60,0:38:30.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,How can this be done?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.41,0:38:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Zhou the Youth's fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.88,0:38:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I will chastise him when I see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.22,0:38:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,State Mother, since the situation is the way it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.32,0:38:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,scolding Zhou Yu will not be of any use.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.66,0:38:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Since we have made a mistake, let us run with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.37,0:39:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,We might have Liu Xuande become your \Nnew son-in-law. Thus, we can avoid ridicule.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.67,0:39:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.16,0:39:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible! Liu Bei is old and my sister is young. I do not think they match.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.08,0:39:17.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The Imperial Uncle is a member of the imperial house and a hero of this land.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.29,0:39:21.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,To marry such a man will \Nnot be shameful to your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.82,0:39:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This cannot be done whatsoever!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.96,0:39:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not argue.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.19,0:39:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I can meet Liu Xuande at Ganlu Monastery tomorrow. Wait until I see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.43,0:39:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,If he is not to my liking, you may deal with him as you please.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.94,0:39:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If I do like him, however, \NI will bless this marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.74,0:39:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.01,0:39:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Since that is your position, I will go make the preparations.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.72,0:39:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhongmou.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.36,0:40:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,For this meeting, you must treat the Imperial Uncle with utmost courtesy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.10,0:40:45.38,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord13.909}Dim grows the flashing of swords and daggers,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.38,0:40:50.70,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord13.909}from afar do sound the battle drums and war horns.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.08,0:40:57.50,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord13.909}Before my eyes rise only those
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.50,0:41:03.10,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord13.909}fresh faces, one after another.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.60,0:41:09.83,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord13.909}Buried are the ancient paths and ways,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.83,0:41:15.14,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord13.909}desolate are the beacon fires and border towns.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.14,0:41:22.98,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord13.909}O, Years! You cannot take away
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.98,0:41:27.15,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord13.909}that succession of familiar lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.13,0:41:34.26,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord13.909}Who is it that determines what flourishes?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.26,0:41:40.66,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord13.909}Is there no basis to prosperity and decline?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.66,0:41:46.62,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord13.909}In a single page, the storm disperses,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.62,0:41:52.70,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord13.909}reshaping space and time.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.70,0:41:59.02,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord13.909}Meeting and parting are always destined,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.02,0:42:05.10,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord13.909}separation and reunion always weighs in our hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.10,0:42:11.10,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord13.909}Take the work of the living upon yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.10,0:42:17.55,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord13.909}unconcerned with your legacy after.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.55,0:42:23.66,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord13.909}The Yangtze has the will to transform into tears,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.66,0:42:29.82,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,670)}{\bord13.909}the Yangtze has sentiment to raise its voice in song,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.82,0:42:35.94,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.909}in the firmament of history\N glimmers a sprinkling of stars,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.94,0:42:57.10,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.909}the spirit of heroism in the world\N thunders onward unbridled
Comment: 0,0:10:52.54,0:10:52.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道自家为自家作保?
Comment: 0,0:13:44.00,0:13:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,子敬如今有困难 我岂能袖手旁观？
Comment: 0,0:13:56.50,0:14:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Silver plate is translated indirectly from 双手 "both hands"
Comment: 0,0:21:24.44,0:21:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我说军师 还是不去为好
Comment: 0,0:37:46.36,0:37:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,好个没有出息的东西 行此下作之事
Comment: 0,0:39:57.26,0:40:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,在国太相婿之前 可要好生看待刘皇叔

